{{- /*
Source: Hindsight hindsight_api/engine/reflect/prompts.py — the inputs DELTA_SYSTEM_PROMPT names (CURRENT DOCUMENT,
CANDIDATE UPDATE, SUPPORTING FACTS), laid out like build_structured_delta_prompt. Observations come before facts.
Data (DeltaData): .Name, .SourceQuery, .CurrentMarkdown, .Candidate, .Observations, .Facts, .DocumentTokens,
.DocumentBudget, .Truncated.
*/ -}}
## Topic
{{.SourceQuery}}{{with .Name}} (document: "{{.}}"){{end}}

## CURRENT DOCUMENT
----- BEGIN CURRENT DOCUMENT -----
{{.CurrentMarkdown}}
----- END CURRENT DOCUMENT -----

## SUPPORTING FACTS (new since last refresh — integrate these)
{{- range .Observations}}
- [observation:{{.ID}}] {{.Text}}{{template "dates" .}}
{{- end}}
{{- range .Facts}}
- [{{with .Type}}{{.}}:{{end}}{{.ID}}] {{.Text}}{{template "dates" .}}
{{- end}}
{{- if and (not .Observations) (not .Facts)}}
(no supporting facts retrieved)
{{- end}}
{{- with .Candidate}}

## CANDIDATE UPDATE (written from the new facts alone — it does not describe what the document lost)
----- BEGIN CANDIDATE UPDATE -----
{{.}}
----- END CANDIDATE UPDATE -----
{{- end}}
{{- if gt .DocumentBudget 0}}
{{- if ge .DocumentTokens .DocumentBudget}}

## Document budget (EXCEEDED)
The document is ~{{.DocumentTokens}} tokens against a budget of {{.DocumentBudget}}. As well as integrating the new facts, make room: remove or merge content that is superseded, duplicated, or no longer helps answer the TOPIC. Reclaim space from stale content — never by dropping the facts you are integrating, and never by summarising a section that is still current into a sentence.
{{- end}}
{{- end}}
{{- if .Truncated}}

*Note: Document or facts were truncated to fit the model context window.*
{{- end}}

## Task
Output the updated document. Integrate the new supporting facts into CURRENT DOCUMENT, changing as little as possible.

{{- define "dates"}}
{{- if or .OccurredStart .MentionedAt}} (
{{- with .OccurredStart}}{{$start := .Format "2006-01-02"}}occurred: {{$start}}
{{- with $.OccurredEnd}}{{$end := .Format "2006-01-02"}}{{if ne $start $end}} to {{$end}}{{end}}{{end}}
{{- end}}
{{- if and .OccurredStart .MentionedAt}}; {{end}}
{{- with .MentionedAt}}mentioned_at: {{.Format "2006-01-02"}}{{end}})
{{- end}}
{{- end}}
